EDAM also places Filament tracing under Image segmentation and Spot detection under Image feature detection; they stay separate categories here because each has its own EDAM class.

An operation can appear in several categories: {{ r.op_link("op:estimate", italic=True) }} and {{ r.op_link("op:apply", italic=True) }} in Image correction and Image registration, {{ r.op_link("op:detect", italic=True) }} in Image segmentation, Spot detection and Object tracking, {{ r.op_link("op:link", italic=True) }} in Object tracking and in Image reshaping when merging objects across FOVs.
